      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Foreign aid isn't a handout; it's an investment in global stability and shared human dignity. When preventable suffering goes unaddressed, the resulting instability often ripples back to impact everyone, including taxpayers at home. By supporting international development, we are actively strengthening global health, education, and economies, ultimately creating a safer and more prosperous world for all. This commitment aligns with a fundamental moral responsibility to alleviate suffering where we have the capacity to do so.",
