      "content": "We must reframe this debate: effective global aid *is* an investment in our own long-term security. Global instability, poverty, and health crises are not separate issues; they are interconnected threats that one day impact our own communities here at home. A robust and just world is the most stable environment for our citizens to thrive, making our commitment abroad a form of preventative, self-interested wisdom. Therefore, supporting global good is not a subtraction from domestic needs, but a vital addition to our overall societal strength.",
